    "text": "hoodline.com\nwebsite\nSan Mateo\nKentucky Man Pleads Guilty to Felony Assault for Vehicle Ramming Incident in San Mateo\nBy Eric Tanaka,\n6 hours agoFrank Falcone, a 62-year-old Kentucky man, has pleaded guilty to felony assault after an incident where he rammed his car into another vehicle over the use of high beams. The guilty plea was confirmed by a social media post from the San Mateo County District Attorney, indicating that Falcone was arrested earlier this year and will face sentencing on October 7.\n3",
